# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# The client configuration the Android build compiles in
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# EVERY VALUE HERE IS ALREADY PUBLIC. Each one is shipped, in the clear,
# inside the JavaScript served from sambramoh.vercel.app -- anyone can
# read them with View Source today. Committing them changes nothing
# about who can see them; it only lets CI build an APK without a
# secrets round-trip.
#
# They are public BY DESIGN, not by accident:
#
#   VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY   the key browsers are meant to hold. It
#                            authorises nothing on its own -- every row
#                            it can reach is decided by RLS, which is
#                            why migrations 074-076 exist.
#
#   VITE_FIREBASE_*          the Firebase web config identifies the
#                            project. Sending a push is authorised by
#                            FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT, on the server.
#
#   VITE_FIREBASE_VAPID_KEY  the PUBLIC half of the VAPID pair.
#
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# WHAT MUST NEVER BE ADDED TO THIS FILE
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY   bypasses RLS entirely
#   FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT    can push to every device
#   RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET         can move money
#
# Those three live in .env (gitignored) and in Vercel, and they are
# unprefixed precisely so Vite cannot expose them. A VITE_ prefix on any
# of them would put it in a public bundle.
#
# The rule: if it is already in the browser, it may be here. If it is
# not, it may not.


VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://twpsgrmoqxemxhrzbfwd.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_bGvf7MW02OCmxC963N1-uw_stJZSYL7
VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=AIzaSyA_VXYk6NDFhIahgM93Wmxuf5MCxWvP5rk
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=sambramo.firebaseapp.com
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=sambramo
VITE_FIREBASE_SENDER_ID=456707017962
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=1:456707017962:web:440c536f9e7ff1a9dd5b93
VITE_FIREBASE_VAPID_KEY=BFsEVj6rUthPh5b72yvWtlOl0Rk0zcRrirsbgp2LaryUtFl7sgEOb1iMk_mPCxjzU8geJNE8ow4bpA3-hwv8tZw
